# Real, non-bench-fixture roster artifact: plain worker roster facts using
# the live plan-admit path's own vocabulary (ceng:rosterDeclaredRole /
# ceng:rosterDepartment), never bench's ObsWriter/roster_admitted
# observation-store shape. Used by
# plan_approval_test.rs::present_plan_derives_real_datalog_roles_for_a_non_bench_roster_artifact
# to prove real Datalog role derivation on the live path.
@prefix ceng: <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/live-roster#> .

ex:worker-avery ceng:rosterDeclaredRole "reviewer" ;
    ceng:rosterDepartment "finance" .
ex:worker-bao ceng:rosterDeclaredRole "approver" ;
    ceng:rosterDepartment "finance" .
ex:worker-caro ceng:rosterDeclaredRole "auditor" ;
    ceng:rosterDepartment "compliance" .
